      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to the pinned validator GET /workspaces?limit=1 rather than a billed message send. list_channels is the nearest allowlisted read; GET /workspaces is not a standalone upstream action id.",
        "Official Accounts API documents GET /organizations/{organizationId}/workspaces. Native follows the pinned validator path GET /workspaces, which does not require a caller-supplied organization id.",
        "Authorization is AccessKey {key} with no Bearer prefix. Native does not send the upstream user-agent.",
        "Native category is messaging (source Communication/Marketing are not in Rust CATEGORIES)."
      ]
    },
